(text "Carga por el USB-C del TP4056 (IN+/IN- son su conector)." (at 12.7 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 97d02371-6217-479d-8ec6-4e48777ae2c5))
(text "D4 es el diodo del elevador y bloquea el retorno del USB del DevKit." (at 12.7 255.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 5ae4656f-7477-43e8-bb00-1840894ae760))
(text "R13/R14: 4.2 V de bateria -> 2.1 V en GPIO10 (ADC1)." (at 12.7 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 10a5309c-820c-475d-b08e-61977980d81f))
(text "Consumo estimado ~400 mA de bateria. 2 x 3000 mAh" (at 12.7 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3d5210ca-3f76-43ee-bb24-fb639203b247))
(text "nominales dan unas 10 h, el doble de las 5 h pedidas." (at 12.7 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 8a097d0b-edff-4f75-9dfe-79f7260cd13c))
(text "MT3608: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R15/R16) = 5.2 V en el riel, con FB despues de D4." (at 12.7 270.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0882b0d9-7697-4dc6-9ebf-1acb8dc22ce7))
(text "EN a VIN. L1 con corriente de saturacion de 3 A o mas." (at 12.7 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4d41dea6-0b6d-439a-ab30-fd75787991c8))
(text "OPCION B: diseno discreto con TP4056, interruptor y MT3608 (alternativa a la opcion A)." (at 12.7 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7e1c33e9-7c6b-488f-bc9a-8ce7f48536e6))
